    "detailed_description": "<strong><i>Surprise Party!</i></strong> Is a <strong>Puzzle/Adventure game</strong> where you play as a <strong>Balloon?! </strong><br>It all started out like every other  escapade led by Bob and his friends. Kids meet up without telling their parents, kids try and break into a circus... only this time, it ended up with them meeting someone intending to throw the entire universe into impending doom. <br><br>But a hero always <strong>rises</strong> up in the face of disaster, right?<br><br><strong>FEATURES</strong><br><br>\u2022 Explore 5 differently themed stages, all riddled with spooky delight!<br><br>\u2022 Avoid enemies in the dark while you solve a variety of Puzzles!<br><br>\u2022 You're a Balloon, silly! Don't Get Popped!<br><br>\u2022 Use Magical Plushies to transform into 3 different Balloon Animals, each with their own special ability!<br><br>\u2022 Meet a cast of colourful  characters! <br><br>\u2022  Based in France! Escargots included!<br><br>\u2022  Collaborative Sound Track, featuring work by Matthew Colucci, Jake Musumeci, Nicholas Hartill-Law, and YouFulca!<br><br>\u2022  Custom level-picking structure, partial voice over... and MORE!<br><br>PLEASE NOTE: Although Surprise Party! is intended for all ages, very young players may be frightened by some scenes or themes.",
    "about_the_game": "<strong><i>Surprise Party!</i></strong> Is a <strong>Puzzle/Adventure game</strong> where you play as a <strong>Balloon?! </strong><br>It all started out like every other  escapade led by Bob and his friends. Kids meet up without telling their parents, kids try and break into a circus... only this time, it ended up with them meeting someone intending to throw the entire universe into impending doom. <br><br>But a hero always <strong>rises</strong> up in the face of disaster, right?<br><br><strong>FEATURES</strong><br><br>\u2022 Explore 5 differently themed stages, all riddled with spooky delight!<br><br>\u2022 Avoid enemies in the dark while you solve a variety of Puzzles!<br><br>\u2022 You're a Balloon, silly! Don't Get Popped!<br><br>\u2022 Use Magical Plushies to transform into 3 different Balloon Animals, each with their own special ability!<br><br>\u2022 Meet a cast of colourful  characters! <br><br>\u2022  Based in France! Escargots included!<br><br>\u2022  Collaborative Sound Track, featuring work by Matthew Colucci, Jake Musumeci, Nicholas Hartill-Law, and YouFulca!<br><br>\u2022  Custom level-picking structure, partial voice over... and MORE!<br><br>PLEASE NOTE: Although Surprise Party! is intended for all ages, very young players may be frightened by some scenes or themes.",
